WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:15.550
Let me tell you something.

3
00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:18.590
You're never going
to save this country.

4
00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:23.260
Goodbye, Princess.

5
00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:17.740
Just in time.

6
00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:24.150
Luffy. Pell.

7
00:02:24.150 --> 00:02:25.450
There isn't much time left

8
00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:28.220
until the Square is blown up.

9
00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:35.230
Everyone is already down there.

10
00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:40.800
My voice can't...
it can't be heard,

11
00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:44.040
no matter how loud I yell.

12
00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:48.580
At this rate, the country will fall apart.

13
00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:52.250
Don't worry, Vivi.

14
00:02:56.100 --> 00:03:00.110
As long as we're here, your voice will always be heard.

15
00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:09.920
I'm telling you again.

16
00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:13.090
My injuries are a whole lot
more severe than yours are.

17
00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:15.390
Oh, quit whining
and act like a man!

18
00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:16.710
My leg is hurt,
so I can't stand!

19
00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:18.420
Oh, no! I'm gonna faint!

20
00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:22.030
You're such a liar!

21
00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:29.240
Best of luck, Luffy. Be careful.

22
00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:33.680
I ate tons of meat,
bird guy. I'll be just fine!

23
00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:39.210
I won't...

24
00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:41.240
...lose to you.

25
00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:45.560
How did he make it out of the
quicksand with all his injuries?

26
00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:54.730
It's Luffy! He's alive!

27
00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:57.040
Tony's here, too.

28
00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.740
What? Luffy!

29
00:03:58.740 --> 00:03:59.540
Luffy!

30
00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:02.350
And Vivi's here, too!

31
00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:04.680
See! See! He's still alive!

32
00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.760
What did I tell you?!
I knew it all along!

33
00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:07.760
Really?

34
00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:09.000
For someone
who knew it all along,

35
00:04:09.030 --> 00:04:10.370
you sure look surprised.

36
00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:15.100
Usopp! Sanji! You're all right!

37
00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:18.210
Ahh! Vivi, what
happened? Are you okay?

38
00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:19.910
You look like you've been hurt!

39
00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:25.750
Nami, too. And Mr. Bushido?

40
00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:29.590
Everyone... is alive.

41
00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:31.390
Usopp, who asked you to create

42
00:04:31.390 --> 00:04:33.890
some useless prop for parties?

43
00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:36.150
Oh, come on! You're
standing up just fine!

44
00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:38.680
Nami, my love!

45
00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:42.290
Well, it did have a powerful
attack. Right, Nami?

46
00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:45.020
Just shut up. I am going
to deal with you later.

47
00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:47.390
Vivi.

48
00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:48.400
What's going on?

49
00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:51.220
What's up with all this dust flying everywhere?

50
00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:53.990
Explain yourself, idiot!

51
00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:56.330
How could you let Nami get injured like that?

52
00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:57.830
What happened?

53
00:04:57.840 --> 00:05:00.040
She's fine, let it go.

54
00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:03.740
Listen, Chopper, do me a favor.

55
00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:05.380
Bury my body out
in the wastelands

56
00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:07.210
when I'm dead and gone. Agh!

57
00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:10.250
No, Usopp! Don't die!

58
00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:12.450
I'm sorry, you guys.

59
00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:15.320
I know I lost to him once already.

60
00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:18.520
This time...

61
00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:19.820
...I'm gonna win!

62
00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:23.060
The rest is up to you!

63
00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:25.390
So get goin' already.

64
00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:30.100
If you can't beat this guy,

65
00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:32.930
then I don't know
anybody who can!

66
00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:41.940
I'm gonna put an end to this.

67
00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.310
For good!

68
00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:46.590
– Yeah!
– Yeah!

69
00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:53.100
Thank you.

70
00:05:53.130 --> 00:05:57.300
After all that's happened,
all of you are still with me.

71
00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:07.300
Crocodile!

72
00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:16.240
Try all you want.

73
00:06:16.280 --> 00:06:20.150
But no matter how many times
you swing, you'll never hit me.

74
00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.920
I guess you didn't get enough the first time, huh?

75
00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:01.360
Now Gum-Gum...

76
00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:03.890
What the...? Who's that?

77
00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:17.240
How can he... hit me?

78
00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:51.980
He hit Crocodile!

79
00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:24.940
Get up.

80
00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:26.000
I figured something out

81
00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:30.010
when some of my Yuba water dropped on your hand.

82
00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:31.880
Once you touch water,

83
00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:35.850
then you can't turn into sand anymore.

84
00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:37.280
You took away all the rain

85
00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:40.980
because you're afraid
of water, didn't you?

86
00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:46.860
I know how to defeat you, Crocodile.

87
00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:51.460
Our real fight is starting now.

88
00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:54.310
Are you serious?

89
00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:57.150
In ten minutes, this place
is really gonna blow up?

90
00:08:58.320 --> 00:08:59.680
Okay, but how do we find him?

91
00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:00.880
Well, not by
standing around here.

92
00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:03.520
But if everything in
this area's going to explode,

93
00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:05.850
then the cannon guy has to
be far away, doesn't he?

94
00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:07.100
Or else he'd just blow up with the rest of it.

95
00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:09.970
No way. No. He's close.

96
00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.610
The cannoneer is
almost certainly

97
00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:13.140
near the Palace Square.

98
00:09:13.180 --> 00:09:15.210
What? Are you serious, Vivi?

99
00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:18.150
But that means he's gonna be
caught in the explosion too!

100
00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.080
I guess that shouldn't be too surprising.

101
00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:21.780
It is Crocodile.

102
00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:24.950
What?! He's just gonna
let his own man die?!

103
00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:28.930
He's just plain evil.

104
00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:31.030
Come on, let's go.

105
00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:42.940
Looks like we found
ya, Princess.

106
00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:45.640
I wonder how big a promotion
Crocodile will give us

107
00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:47.350
for killing you.

108
00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:49.820
Billions!

109
00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:51.720
It looks like we'll lose some time.

110
00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:55.560
He's right, so let's not waste
all of it jibber-jabbering.

111
00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:56.620
– Let's go.
– Let's go.

112
00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:57.760
I'll go ahead.

113
00:09:57.790 --> 00:09:59.490
– Yeah, us too!
– Yeah, us too!

114
00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:04.840
Your counting is not helping.

115
00:10:04.840 --> 00:10:05.670
Let's split up.

116
00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:06.940
We need to get out
of this dust devil

117
00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:08.910
if we're gonna find anything.

118
00:10:10.950 --> 00:10:13.080
Ten minutes!

119
00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:14.720
All right, now let's go. Hurry!

120
00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:15.540
Yeah.

121
00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:19.540
This is really it.
This is the last chance.

122
00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:23.650
In ten minutes,

123
00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:27.590
the country's fate could
be decided for good!

124
00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:38.700
Come on, you think
you can defeat me?

125
00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:39.200
Sure do.

126
00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:41.400
I'll admit I'm impressed
you figured it out.

127
00:10:41.430 --> 00:10:44.940
Especially since you
were about to die.

128
00:10:44.970 --> 00:10:46.810
But I hope you realize something like that

129
00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:50.440
isn't nearly enough to make this an even fight.

130
00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:54.050
I am one of the Seven
Warlords of the Sea.

131
00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:56.820
So what if you're one of
the Seven dumb Warlords?

132
00:10:56.850 --> 00:10:58.130
I guess that makes me...

133
00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:00.270
...the eighth Warlord.

134
00:11:03.090 --> 00:11:05.360
Really? Who is that guy?

135
00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:09.790
He's a pirate. I'm surprised
you haven't heard about him yet.

136
00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:11.460
He's helped your darling Princess Vivi

137
00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:14.100
escape from death a few times now.

138
00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:16.870
So then, he is the
one responsible

139
00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:19.400
for bringing Vivi back?

140
00:11:20.810 --> 00:11:22.820
Gum-Gum...

141
00:11:22.850 --> 00:11:24.720
...Pistol!

142
00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:27.120
If I dodge it, then it's no use.

143
00:11:27.150 --> 00:11:30.160
My hand can still absorb any fluid on you.

144
00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:31.860
For that matter,
my hand can absorb

145
00:11:31.890 --> 00:11:34.260
all the water in
your body as well.

146
00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:37.000
Ah, crap, forgot
about that trick.

147
00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:52.780
All right, not bad.

148
00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:56.780
But remember
how you told me...

149
00:11:56.810 --> 00:12:00.980
...Devil Fruit Powers
get stronger?

150
00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:03.190
Gum-Gum... Pistol!

151
00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:11.330
Shotgun!

152
00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:12.760
Stupid brat!

153
00:12:12.820 --> 00:12:15.490
Desert Spada!

154
00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:17.030
Uh-oh.

155
00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:24.770
Just barely!

156
00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:26.900
Now, Gum-Gum...

157
00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:30.570
You just keep using the same move against me.

158
00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:32.240
Do you wanna win?

159
00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:35.040
Yeah! And I'm going to!

160
00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:40.210
That's been my plan
from the beginning!

161
00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:41.650
Time for you to get wet!

162
00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:44.040
Of course your plan
was obvious!

163
00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:45.980
Sables!

164
00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:58.050
Barrel!

165
00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:04.260
You're struggling so hard, Straw Hat Luffy.

166
00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:05.530
You can't do anything at all

167
00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:08.430
without that barrel of
yours, now can you?

168
00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:09.400
This isn't any different

169
00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:12.400
from my first fight
against you after all.

170
00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:16.810
Yeah, you're right, Crocodile.

171
00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:18.810
It isn't any different like this.

172
00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:30.540
How about this?

173
00:13:30.570 --> 00:13:33.440
Now I'm not the same as I was, huh?

174
00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:35.910
You gotta be kidding me.

175
00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:40.350
Water Luffy. Ha-ha!

176
00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:42.820
Oh, no! A leak.

177
00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:46.320
He can't be serious
about this, can he?

178
00:13:49.310 --> 00:13:51.620
I guess I shouldn't
drunk that much water.

179
00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:57.290
Does this idiot
really not understand

180
00:13:57.320 --> 00:13:59.160
what's going on here?

181
00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:10.600
Damn it, stop your
messing around!

182
00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:25.120
Damn that brat!

183
00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:28.220
Who said I was messing around?

184
00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:30.220
My body...

185
00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:33.020
I'm always serious!
Let me show ya!

186
00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:35.330
Now Gum-Gum...

187
00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:39.960
...Bazooka!

188
00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:04.470
How was that,
Sand Croc?

189
00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:09.140
That's amazing!
He beat Crocodile?

190
00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:11.600
There's no time now for all this admiration.

191
00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:13.770
We have other things to do.

192
00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:21.480
Get up.
It's time for us to get moving.

193
00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:24.980
You are going to show me the way to the Poneglyph.

194
00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:26.690
What're you planning to do?

195
00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:29.060
How could looking at it possibly help you?

196
00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:34.320
Just stop asking questions.

197
00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:37.430
All you have to do is show me where it is.

198
00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:45.320
Your luck's beginning to run out.

199
00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:49.420
You certainly did try, but
there's not much time left.

200
00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:54.520
You should get
going now, Nico Robin.

201
00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:58.230
Unless you want to be dried up along with this brat.

202
00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:02.660
Go. Now. I'm done playing games.

203
00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:05.130
Nico Robin?

204
00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:09.470
Yes, as you wish.

205
00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:12.280
Listen up, Straw Hat.

206
00:16:12.310 --> 00:16:15.380
I'm going to destroy every last rock on this ground.

207
00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:17.520
And you along with them.

208
00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:28.230
All the grass is dying.

209
00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:35.630
Ground Secco!

210
00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:44.610
Falling!

211
00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:47.520
Ah! That was close!

212
00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:52.580
All right.
Water-Water... Pistol!

213
00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:57.790
Ah! His hand sucked it up.

214
00:16:57.880 --> 00:16:59.380
You actually
thought you could

215
00:16:59.420 --> 00:17:03.620
kill my powers, didn't
you, Water Luffy?

216
00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:08.430
That was a very
foolish mistake to make.

217
00:17:08.430 --> 00:17:14.000
The true power of sand is
drying things out. Watch.

218
00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:15.900
My right hand can suck the life

219
00:17:15.940 --> 00:17:18.940
out of anything by
turning it to dust.

220
00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:21.810
Its power is limitless.

221
00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:48.500
He wasn't exaggerating.

222
00:17:48.530 --> 00:17:51.400
Even the statues are crumbling!

223
00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:57.510
Everything is just dying.

224
00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:00.370
My sandal!

225
00:18:00.400 --> 00:18:04.040
Everything that is connected to the ground is done for.

226
00:18:04.070 --> 00:18:05.910
Including you.

227
00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:08.810
Ground Death!

228
00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:31.270
What impeccable timing

229
00:18:31.300 --> 00:18:34.340
you Marines have,
showing up right now.

230
00:18:34.370 --> 00:18:36.540
Get out of the way.
We're in a hurry.

231
00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:37.610
No chance!

232
00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:38.810
Thanks to one of the soldiers,

233
00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:41.070
I know everything that's been
going on here in Alubarna.

234
00:18:41.110 --> 00:18:42.850
We're not moving.

235
00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:45.850
That man, do you have
any idea who he is?

236
00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:47.160
Yes, and I don't care.

237
00:18:47.190 --> 00:18:48.820
I'm not listening to him, you,

238
00:18:48.820 --> 00:18:50.550
or anyone else from
the government,

239
00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:51.950
and I would strongly recommend

240
00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:55.420
that you and your men
get out of my way.

241
00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:58.510
We have no intention of giving way to you!

242
00:18:58.550 --> 00:19:00.920
Well then, you may not live much longer.

243
00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:03.560
Please hold on!
Don't be worried about me!

244
00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:04.950
We've been warned that at 4:30,

245
00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:07.120
a bomb is going to be shot
into the Palace Square

246
00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:09.490
where the fighting's going on.

247
00:19:09.530 --> 00:19:11.800
Please, you have to go stop it now!

248
00:19:11.840 --> 00:19:15.470
That's only... minutes from now!

249
00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:16.450
If this attack happens,

250
00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:18.980
it'll cost a million citizens their lives!

251
00:19:19.020 --> 00:19:20.890
Well.

252
00:19:20.920 --> 00:19:24.160
All right. We'll save you and
then we'll stop the attack.

253
00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:25.550
Wait! You don't know who she is!

254
00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:27.750
Ready, men?

255
00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:29.750
Move out of my way.

256
00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:32.570
Treinta Fleurs!

257
00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:33.740
Strangle!

258
00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:35.910
A Devil Fruit.

259
00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:37.950
I said I was in a hurry, didn't I?

260
00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:40.810
Don't make me angry with you.

261
00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:45.920
That's her! It's
really Nico Robin!

262
00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:47.150
I'm sure of it.

263
00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:48.790
I looked up her old
wanted poster

264
00:19:48.820 --> 00:19:51.190
because Captain Smoker
had asked me to do so.

265
00:19:51.220 --> 00:19:53.560
That's really her.

266
00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:54.740
She has a bounty.

267
00:19:54.740 --> 00:19:57.610
Twenty years ago, the whole world was talking about her.

268
00:19:57.640 --> 00:19:58.670
I still remember the articles

269
00:19:58.690 --> 00:20:02.100
that appeared in the
newspaper around that time.

270
00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:06.570
In a terrifying incident, six
Marine warships were destroyed.

271
00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:08.140
They said that an eight-year-old
girl was responsible

272
00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:09.270
for sinking them.

273
00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:11.970
The government classified
her as a first-degree risk,

274
00:20:12.010 --> 00:20:14.410
and they put an incredible
bounty on her head.

275
00:20:14.510 --> 00:20:18.610
Seventy-nine million Berries!
It's still an amazing sum!

276
00:20:18.660 --> 00:20:22.130
But after that, she just suddenly disappeared.

277
00:20:22.210 --> 00:20:24.040
Stop your pointless rambling!

278
00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:28.010
Either move out of my way
or you're all dead. Okay?

279
00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:31.640
It's useless having
this many soldiers fight her.

280
00:20:33.220 --> 00:20:34.420
Sergeant!

281
00:20:34.440 --> 00:20:36.910
Take the men and head to the
Square to stop the explosion.

282
00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:38.150
But, Sergeant Major...!

283
00:20:38.180 --> 00:20:40.790
Just do it! There's
only minutes left!

284
00:20:40.820 --> 00:20:42.420
Right!

285
00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:51.000
Now, let that man go right away!

286
00:20:51.030 --> 00:20:53.830
I've already warned you to move!

287
00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:29.060
That was bad.

288
00:21:29.090 --> 00:21:33.590
That right hand of his is gonna be a big problem.

289
00:21:33.630 --> 00:21:37.060
The entire lawn has been turned into a desert.

290
00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:41.770
Oh, great. Where'd he go now?

291
00:21:48.980 --> 00:21:52.610
I'm quite tired of wasting my time with you.

292
00:22:01.990 --> 00:22:04.690
Missed me.

293
00:22:20.240 --> 00:22:24.410
You have lost to me...
two times now,

294
00:22:24.440 --> 00:22:27.310
Straw Hat Luffy.
